{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"平展基本群"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"平展基本群"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"概形","text":"概形"}},{"Plain":"的平展基本群是其"},{"Local":{"url":"平展意象","text":"平展意象"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"∞-意象的形","text":"形"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"基本群","text":"基本群"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>作为纤维函子的自同构群</h3>\n<p>类似于 "},{"Local":{"url":"淡中对偶","text":"Tannaka 重构"}},{"Plain":",</p>\n<p>参考 "},{"Local":{"url":"MilneLEC","text":"Milne 平展上同调讲义"}},{"Plain":".\n对于概形 $X$, 记 $\\mathsf{FEt}_{/X}$ 为指向 $X$ 的有限平展映射的范畴. 对于"},{"Local":{"url":"几何点","text":"几何点"}},{"Plain":" $\\bar x \\to X$,\n定义"},{"Local":{"url":"纤维函子","text":"纤维函子"}},{"Plain":" $F \\colon \\mathsf{FEt}_{/X}\\to\\mathsf{Set}$,\n$$\r\nF(Y\\to X) := \\operatorname{Hom}_X(\\bar x,Y).\r\n$$\n函子 $F$ 是 "},{"Local":{"url":"pro-可表函子","text":"pro-可表"}},{"Plain":"的. 记 $\\widetilde {X}$ 为 $F$ 的表示 "},{"Local":{"url":"pro-对象","text":"pro-对象"}},{"Plain":", 定义\n$$\r\n\\pi_1(X,\\bar x) := \\operatorname{Aut}_{\\mathsf{ProFEt}_{/X}}(\\widetilde {X}) = \\operatorname{lim}\\operatorname{Aut}_{\\mathsf{FEt}_{/X}}(X_i)\r\n$$\n后一个等式来自 "},{"Local":{"url":"pro-对象","text":"pro-对象"}},{"Plain":"的态射的计算. ("},{"Local":{"url":"todo","text":"todo"}},{"Plain":")</p>\n<h3>作为形的基本群</h3>\n<p>平展基本群是"},{"Local":{"url":"平展意象","text":"平展意象"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"∞-意象的形","text":"形"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"基本群","text":"基本群"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>与主丛的关系</h3>\n<p>设 $X$ 为连通概形, $G$ 为有限群, 则 $X$ 的 $G$-系数 $1$ 阶"},{"Local":{"url":"非Abel上同调","text":"非 Abel"}},{"Plain":" "},{"Local":{"url":"平展上同调","text":"平展上同调"}},{"Plain":"等同于 $X$ 的平展基本群到 $G$ 的同态:\n$$\r\nH^1(X_{\\mathrm{\\'et}},G) \\simeq \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathrm{cts}}(\\pi_1(X,\\bar x),G).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>设基环 $k$ 为特征 $0$ 代数闭域, $\\mathbb G_m$ 的有限平展覆叠为 $(-)^n\\colon \\mathbb G_m \\to\\mathbb G_m$. 因此\n$$\r\n\\pi_1^{\\text{\\'et}}(\\mathbb G_m) = \\operatorname{lim}_n \\mathbb{Z}/(n) = \\widehat {\\mathbb{Z}}.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}